@GRM_Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@authToken = eyJhbGciOi...

### Register a new customer
POST {{GRM_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "johndoe",
  "email": "johndoe@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "123-456-7890",
  "address": "123 Elm Street"
}

### Login (returns JWT)
POST {{GRM_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUsername": "johndoe@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Get Current User (Any logged in)
GET {{GRM_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Logout (Any logged in)
POST {{GRM_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### View Customer Profile (Customer role)
GET {{GRM_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Update Customer Profile (Customer role)
PUT {{GRM_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Updated Doe",
  "phoneNumber": "987-654-3210",
  "address": "456 Oak Avenue"
}
